Subtracting eqn. (1) and (2),
$\begin{aligned}
\operatorname{adj}\left(A^{-1}\right)-(\operatorname{adj} A)^{-1} & =\left[\begin{array}{ll}
0 & 0 \\
0 & 0
\end{array}\right] \\
& =\text { null matrix. }
\end{aligned}$

